rsetup-next (0.5.0~alpha1-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial package for the Rust control center.
  * Replace the legacy Bash package split with one CLI, TUI, and Web binary.
  * Build Cargo dependencies offline from a package-local cache.
  * Link the executable statically for Debian 12 runtime compatibility.
  * Add a Polkit-authorized fixed-operation helper for unprivileged GUIs.
  * Migrate SSH, Docker, and reversible sleep management operations.
  * Add overlay, read-only GPIO, camera snapshot, and thermal policy tools.
  * Add native LED and backed-up SPI boot flash management.
  * Add a validated temperature-driven pwm-fan curve service.

 -- xzl <xiangzelong@radxa.com>  Thu, 03 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0800
